.DS_Store
*.log
.local/
node_modules/
mcp-server/node_modules/

# Test and benchmark output. mcp-server/full-suite-runner.mjs writes run folders
# here and mcp-server/benchmark-performance.mjs writes reports/performance/,
# both of which capture whatever pages the run drove, including signed-in ones.
# Keep every run local.
reports/

# Everything moved out of the public tree: the author's own report archive, the
# personal launchd plist, the source artwork, and the one-off client job
# scripts. Mirrors the public layout, so .private/mcp-server/x.mjs is the file
# that used to sit at mcp-server/x.mjs.
.private/

# The local record of one machine's real paths, keys, and launchd label. Written
# by hand, never published. Ships as a template only in docs/install.md.
docs/private-setup.md

# Built extension packages from scripts/package-extension.sh.
dist/

# Local page-recipe plugins, never published. The extension recipe files, the
# MCP plugin modules that pair with them, and the suites that exercise both.
# Every build discovers whatever these folders hold, so a clone without them
# runs green and advertises exactly the built-in tool surface.
extension/recipes/
mcp-server/plugins/
tests/local/

# The internal parity implementation spec. It names the maintainer's own machine
# layout and the third-party products the local page recipes drive, and docs/ is
# a published directory, so it stays local. release-check.mjs scans untracked
# files, so an unignored copy here also turns the identity gate red.
docs/CiC_Parity_Implementation_Spec.md

# Store submission working files: the screenshot set staged for upload, the
# submission evidence capture, and the Python bytecode cache next to
# store/paste_stepper.py. All regenerated, none reviewable.
store/__pycache__/
store/shots/
store/submit_evidence_*.png

# Dated branding archives kept while the icon work settled. The current set under
# branding/icons/ and branding/store-screenshots/ is the tracked one.
branding/*_old_*/
branding/mark_v1_archive_*/
branding/icons_glyph_*/
branding/extension_ui_evidence_*/

# State the store watcher writes back into the tree on every run.
scripts/automation/*-state.json
scripts/automation/store-watch-result.md
